{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tennis Antics has all the playability of traditional tennis with the inclusion of pure unadulterated fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hitting the ball is only half the fun. Unlike conventional tennis, players win by making their opponents run out of energy. Never fear - because the racket is not your only weapon. While concentrating on returning the ball, players can collect fireballs, bombs and stacks of other items to give each and every participant that special chance of winning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tennis Antics includes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 distinctive, fun-filled courts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 unique characters with their own moves and abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 14 different power ups to mix up the action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Local multiplayer support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- NEW: Support for gamepads</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3485900?t=1743005828","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485900/04a1200a0d08ae9a5e74196e1653557f0dfc0b4d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743005828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485900/8f221ba8dae46a18548063f97070831ea47fa592/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743005828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485900/8f221ba8dae46a18548063f97070831ea47fa592/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743005828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descr